{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0472_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0472_1003_009rit", "source_sha256": "10f0b5332cf6bb401067fc4cc471b8c18323d51acd0f8b3d6c936112fd403834", "ja": "ふふ、気づきました？　実はさっきまで、友達と\n近くのお祭りに行ってたんですけど……。", "zh": "呵呵，注意到了吗？其实刚才我和朋友一起去了附近的祭典……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0472_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0472_1004_009rit", "source_sha256": "c8f50aa434fc9536035ffe52efd72e55c93762e5ed0fc9c921ac5cb87183cef7", "ja": "遅くまで残業するって聞いてたので、\nなにか差し入れを持ってきてあげようかなって。", "zh": "听说您要加班到很晚，所以我想着要不要带点慰问品过来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0472_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0472_1005_p", "source_sha256": "09e267d56f3c794f033fc0f422acbb8d8c997c879f99e73032197eafc55b7b14", "ja": "おお、そうだったのか。わざわざすまないな。\nこの匂い……たこ焼きかな？", "zh": "哦，原来是这样啊。还特意送过来，真是麻烦你了。\n这个香味……是章鱼烧吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0472_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0472_1006_009rit", "source_sha256": "e2d153e82d94ce1c791d327a4290457bf3794f8ac963549c92d54064715539c3", "ja": "正解です！　はい、遠慮なくどうぞ。\nお仕事を頑張ってるご褒美です。……なんて。", "zh": "答对了！来，请别客气。\n这是给努力工作的奖励。……开玩笑的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0472_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0472_1007_p", "source_sha256": "668afa8972e6d09023971742fbd87f9dec05ab8b31eb98f427af779771347f26", "ja": "ありがたい。ちょうど小腹が空いてたんだ。\nこれでラストスパートも頑張れそうだよ。", "zh": "太感谢了。肚子刚好有点饿呢。\n这下最后的冲刺也能加把劲了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0472_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0472_1008_009rit", "source_sha256": "557e256502dd9fdbc534ddc6262b659bbef2a65727eb847c703771c4611263d3", "ja": "ふふ、よかったです。じゃ、ご褒美ついでに私も少し\n手伝いますね。ふたりで一気に終わらせましょう！", "zh": "呵呵，那就好。那我也借着奖励的机会稍微帮帮忙吧。我们俩一口气把它完成吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0472_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0472_1009_p", "source_sha256": "461a720964054449ac7190422e133a082b66a03caceb6874a34f9949ca8b2d08", "ja": "（律子の差し入れとサポートのおかげで、予想より\n早く終わらせることができた。正直、助かったな）", "zh": "（多亏了律子的慰问品和帮助，比预想中更早完成了。说实话，真是帮大忙了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
